CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyIntro::
    .string "Hey! You made it back!\p"
    .string "Thanks for guiding me through\n"
    .string "ROCK TUNNEL's currents.\p"
    .string "The POWER PLANT is stable again,\n"
    .string "and I learned a lot watching how\l"
    .string "you handled the flow.\p"
    .string "Now it's time for an official\n"
    .string "GYM challenge.\p"
    .string "My policy is an all-out offensive\n"
    .string "with WATER-type POKéMON!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM03::
    .string "TM03 teaches WATER PULSE.\p"
    .string "Use it on an aquatic POKéMON!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_ExplainCascadeBadge::
    .string "With two BADGES, POKéMON up\n"
    .string "to Lv. 30 obey.\p"
    .string "That includes even outsiders you\n"
    .string "got in trades.\p"
    .string "A puny fish can become a mighty,\n"
    .string "raging POKéMON.\p"
    .string "Bring me that GYARADOS.\n"
    .string "Then I'll show you trade evolution\l"
    .string "with a natural held item.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_TakeThisWithYou::
    .string "You can have the CASCADEBADGE.\p"
    .string "And with it, take this board.\n"
    .string "It will carry you across water.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedCascadeBoardFromMisty::
    .string "{PLAYER} received the CASCADE BOARD\n"
    .string "from MISTY.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM03FromMisty::
    .string "{PLAYER} received TM03\n"
    .string "from MISTY.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_BetterMakeRoomForThis::
    .string "You better make room for this!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyDefeat::
    .string "Wow!\n"
    .string "You're too much!\p"
    .string "All right!\p"
    .string "You can have the CASCADEBADGE to\n"
    .string "show you beat me.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyGyaradosReminder::
    .string "A puny fish can become a mighty,\n"
    .string "raging POKéMON.\p"
    .string "Bring me that GYARADOS.\n"
    .string "Then I'll show you trade evolution\l"
    .string "with a natural held item.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyOfferTrade::
    .string "You brought GYARADOS?\n"
    .string "Perfect!\p"
    .string "Some POKéMON evolve when traded\n"
    .string "while holding something natural.\p"
    .string "My POLIWHIRL is holding a\n"
    .string "KING'S ROCK.\p"
    .string "Will you trade GYARADOS\n"
    .string "for my POLIWHIRL?$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyDeclineTrade::
    .string "No rush.\p"
    .string "Bring me GYARADOS when you want\n"
    .string "to see that evolution in motion.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyNotGyarados::
    .string "That's not the mighty POKéMON\n"
    .string "that grows from MAGIKARP.\p"
    .string "Bring me GYARADOS and I'll show\n"
    .string "you something interesting.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyTradeComplete::
    .string "There it is...\n"
    .string "POLITOED!\p"
    .string "A POLIWHIRL traded with a\n"
    .string "KING'S ROCK can change into\l"
    .string "something completely new.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyTradeDone::
    .string "POLITOED is proof that evolution\n"
    .string "can follow the flow of an item\l"
    .string "and a trade.\p"
    .string "Keep watching how POKéMON change.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_DianaIntro::
    .string "What? You?\n"
    .string "I'm more than good enough for you!\p"
    .string "MISTY won't have to be bothered.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_DianaDefeat::
    .string "You overwhelmed me!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_DianaPostBattle::
    .string "You have to face other TRAINERS\n"
    .string "to see how good you really are.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_LuisIntro::
    .string "Splash!\p"
    .string "I'm first up!\n"
    .string "Let's do it!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_LuisDefeat::
    .string "That can't be!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_LuisPostBattle::
    .string "MISTY is a TRAINER who's going to\n"
    .string "keep improving.\p"
    .string "She won't lose to someone like you!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice::
    .string "Yo!\n"
    .string "Champ in the making!\p"
    .string "Let me give you some advice!\p"
    .string "The LEADER, MISTY, is a pro who\n"
    .string "uses WATER-type POKéMON.\p"
    .string "You can drain all their water with\n"
    .string "GRASS-type POKéMON.\p"
    .string "Or, you might use ELECTRIC-type\n"
    .string "POKéMON and zap them!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyBackFromRockTunnel::
    .string "MISTY's back from ROCK TUNNEL!\p"
    .string "Sounds like guiding her through\n"
    .string "those currents helped settle\l"
    .string "something big.\p"
    .string "Want some advice before you\n"
    .string "challenge her?$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyLetsMakeWaves::
    .string "All right!\n"
    .string "Let's make waves!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyShowMisty::
    .string "All right!\p"
    .string "Then go show MISTY what you\n"
    .string "learned in ROCK TUNNEL!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymGuideMistyAway::
    .string "Hold up!\p"
    .string "MISTY's away from the GYM.\n"
    .string "She's investigating the water\l"
    .string "currents running through\l"
    .string "ROCK TUNNEL.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymGuideMistyStillAway::
    .string "MISTY's still away from the GYM.\p"
    .string "Try checking the water currents\n"
    .string "inside ROCK TUNNEL.$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_WeMakePrettyGoodTeam::
    .string "You beat MISTY!\n"
    .string "See, what'd I tell ya?\p"
    .string "You and me, kid, we make a pretty\n"
    .string "darn-good team!$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue::
    .string "CERULEAN POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: MISTY\p"
    .string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}$"

CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon::
    .string "CERULEAN POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: MISTY\p"
    .string "WINNING TRAINERS:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$"
